WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:06.249
«Tests and exams» → «Results and rating» → «Class and group».

2
00:00:06.249 --> 00:00:09.096
Choose the class.

3
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:19.160
«Who did what» – tests and exams per student: score, ✗ – not taken, ⏳ – still open.

4
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:25.438
«Missing only» – a short list of the tests each student has not done.

5
00:00:25.438 --> 00:00:33.650
«🖨 Print for the class» prepares the list as a PDF; «One sheet per student» prints a separate sheet for each student.
